1
00:00:23,776 --> 00:00:28,515
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

2
00:00:28,515 --> 00:00:32,227
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

3
00:00:32,451 --> 00:00:34,696
♪A cold face♪

4
00:00:35,043 --> 00:00:37,750
♪With two lines of tears♪

5
00:00:38,629 --> 00:00:43,157
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

6
00:00:43,157 --> 00:00:46,789
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

7
00:00:47,267 --> 00:00:50,755
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

8
00:00:52,899 --> 00:00:55,395
♪The storyteller says♪

9
00:00:55,395 --> 00:01:00,035
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

10
00:01:00,423 --> 00:01:02,083
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

11
00:01:02,083 --> 00:01:08,035
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

12
00:01:08,227 --> 00:01:11,915
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

13
00:01:11,915 --> 00:01:15,486
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

14
00:01:15,651 --> 00:01:22,595
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

15
00:01:23,043 --> 00:01:26,664
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

16
00:01:26,664 --> 00:01:30,348
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

17
00:01:30,435 --> 00:01:35,363
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

18
00:01:35,363 --> 00:01:39,523
♪How can I bear to let go♪

19
00:01:43,267 --> 00:01:46,819
=Whispers of Southern Song=

20
00:01:47,363 --> 00:01:50,019
=Episode 14=

21
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:54,200
Stop!

22
00:01:58,280 --> 00:02:01,719
Governor Xu, what brings you here?

23
00:02:01,959 --> 00:02:03,599
Since when did this place belong to you?

24
00:02:04,319 --> 00:02:07,719
You should be grateful and kowtow to me

25
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:11,000
that I don't charge you with a crime
for breaking into this place.

26
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:15,319
Governor Xu, don't be so arrogant.

27
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:20,479
Aren't you afraid
that you'll die a miserable death

28
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:22,639
once you fall?

29
00:02:25,159 --> 00:02:26,400
Rest assured, President Du.

30
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:32,400
You won't live to see that day.

31
00:02:45,039 --> 00:02:45,840
Let's go.

32
00:02:50,199 --> 00:02:53,039
Darn it! How dare he talk nonsense here!

33
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:57,159
(It seems Rong Xiaonan
took the phoenix crown before them.)

34
00:02:58,439 --> 00:03:01,568
(The Xiaosheng Society cares so much
about the Buddha Head and phoenix crown.)

35
00:03:01,879 --> 00:03:03,719
(What exactly are they after?)

36
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:08,240
Send men to station here.

37
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:10,520
Don't let anyone in.

38
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:14,000
Besides, hide that fake Buddha Head

39
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:16,280
and don't let anyone know.

40
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:17,080
Yes!

41
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:23,599
(Right now, the only way
to keep the Xiaosheng Society in check)

42
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,759
(is to hold the Buddha Head
in my hands.)

43
00:03:31,719 --> 00:03:33,360
Miss, a guest is here.

44
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,360
Miss Jiang,

45
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:39,080
I'm Song Mianxiang, the coroner.

46
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:41,120
I need to see Governor.

47
00:03:41,439 --> 00:03:42,240
Oh.

48
00:03:42,479 --> 00:03:43,360
Dr. Song,

49
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,520
he is not in the residence right now.

50
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:47,120
If you have urgent business,

51
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:49,599
I can let the maid take you
to the main hall to wait.

52
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:57,800
Dr. Song, what do you want?

53
00:03:59,439 --> 00:04:01,240
I came to deliver
a document to Governor,

54
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:08,520
concerning the real murderer
of the case from eight years ago.

55
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,479
I told you

56
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:16,399
if you have urgent business,
go wait in the main hall.

57
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:21,079
Besides seeing Governor,

58
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:26,839
I also wanted to see what kind of woman

59
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:28,480
can make Governor fall for her.

60
00:04:29,879 --> 00:04:32,959
So you are using official business
as an excuse

61
00:04:32,959 --> 00:04:34,784
to discuss personal matters
with Governor?

62
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:39,800
Miss Jiang, would you be interested
in hearing about this personal matter?

63
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:44,360
You wait outside.

64
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:44,860
Yes.

65
00:04:50,279 --> 00:04:51,079
Don't scream,

66
00:04:51,759 --> 00:04:53,480
or I'll silence you forever.

67
00:04:56,199 --> 00:04:57,000
Wait.

68
00:04:57,279 --> 00:04:58,600
We don't even know each other,

69
00:04:58,680 --> 00:04:59,759
nor do we have any grudge.

70
00:04:59,839 --> 00:05:00,959
What are you doing now?

71
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:06,879
We don't know each other?

72
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:08,000
We have no grudge?

73
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:11,240
Eight years ago,
I was abducted to the Jiang family,

74
00:05:12,079 --> 00:05:14,319
and forced to learn opera
from your mother

75
00:05:14,319 --> 00:05:15,800
to serve men.

76
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:19,439
Your father abused me,

77
00:05:19,959 --> 00:05:21,040
humiliated me,

78
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:24,600
even forced me to serve those big shots,
in exchange for benefits.

79
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:30,160
The Jiang family is the culprit
that brought me suffering.

80
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:31,079
Impossible!

81
00:05:31,399 --> 00:05:32,480
Nonsense!

82
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:34,560
My parents were honorable
throughout their lives.

83
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:37,759
To think you can tarnish
their reputation with some nonsense?

84
00:05:39,879 --> 00:05:41,839
Are you pretending

85
00:05:42,079 --> 00:05:43,399
or have you really forgotten?

86
00:05:45,319 --> 00:05:46,120
Fine.

87
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:49,040
No matter what,

88
00:05:50,639 --> 00:05:52,120
I'll help you remember.

89
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:32,600
(Gu Fengqiu, Jiang Chun'er's mother)
Learn it hard.

90
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:35,584
(Young Jiang Chun'er)

91
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:39,279
Look up.

92
00:06:59,519 --> 00:07:00,680
Take Chun'er away.

93
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:01,399
Yes.

94
00:07:20,864 --> 00:07:24,416
(Governor Mansion)

95
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:26,959
Xu You'an.

96
00:07:29,199 --> 00:07:30,079
Drive him away.

97
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:33,800
Mr. Rong, please leave.

98
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:36,839
The one who killed your mother
wasn't my master.

99
00:07:36,879 --> 00:07:38,079
He was framed.

100
00:07:38,519 --> 00:07:40,199
The murderers were Xu Fan
and Jiang Xiaoren.

101
00:07:40,199 --> 00:07:41,600
They lured and abused women.

102
00:07:41,639 --> 00:07:42,720
To cover up their crimes,

103
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:43,800
they murdered them

104
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:45,120
and framed my master.

105
00:07:52,519 --> 00:07:53,319
Chun'er.

106
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:57,839
Stop!

107
00:08:09,519 --> 00:08:10,360
Song Mianxiang?

108
00:08:11,399 --> 00:08:12,800
Why is she in the Governor Mansion?

109
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:23,720
What happened to Chun'er?

110
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:24,759
I don't know.

111
00:08:24,759 --> 00:08:28,480
Just now, Miss Jiang was talking
with a doctor named Song Mianxiang.

112
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:30,399
Soon, screams came from the room.

113
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:35,240
Song Mianxiang?

114
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:38,879
You may leave now.

115
00:08:38,879 --> 00:08:39,679
Yes.

116
00:08:48,039 --> 00:08:48,840
Governor,

117
00:08:49,519 --> 00:08:50,919
we found Song Mianxiang's home.

118
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:11,279
Are you okay?

119
00:09:14,639 --> 00:09:15,600
Xu You'an.

120
00:09:20,879 --> 00:09:23,679
M-My father wouldn't do that.

121
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:25,960
He was a good man.

122
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:28,240
He was so good to me.

123
00:09:28,679 --> 00:09:30,639
How could he be such a person?

124
00:09:31,639 --> 00:09:33,039
Who told you this?

125
00:09:34,519 --> 00:09:35,840
What exactly happened?

126
00:09:36,919 --> 00:09:38,559
What did Song Mianxiang tell you?

127
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:44,039
She pricked me with a needle.

128
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:48,600
Then I saw my father forcing

129
00:09:49,399 --> 00:09:51,039
a group of girls to learn opera

130
00:09:51,559 --> 00:09:53,399
and serve others.

131
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:56,720
H-He even killed people.

132
00:10:00,440 --> 00:10:02,360
(Could what Rong Xiaonan said be true?)

133
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:05,080
This can't be true, right?

134
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,279
But why...

135
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:10,039
But why have I never
remembered this before?

136
00:10:11,759 --> 00:10:13,720
I don't remember anything.

137
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:15,559
Anything...

138
00:10:18,559 --> 00:10:19,360
It's okay.

139
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:20,799
It's okay.

140
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:22,919
The doctor said

141
00:10:24,279 --> 00:10:25,840
you need to rest for a while.

142
00:10:28,519 --> 00:10:30,600
I will get to the bottom of this.

143
00:10:33,159 --> 00:10:35,639
Don't worry. I'm here.

144
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:45,600
Interesting!

145
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:58,519
They're investigating the case
from eight years ago.

146
00:10:59,279 --> 00:11:02,039
Before they find out the truth,

147
00:11:03,279 --> 00:11:08,240
have your people incite the public
to push Jiang Chun'er to her death,

148
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:13,559
and seize the chance to pull Xu You'an
down from the Governor position.

149
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,559
I haven't found the phoenix crown.

150
00:11:18,879 --> 00:11:20,759
Why would I trust you once more?

151
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:25,320
If the truth from eight years ago
comes to light,

152
00:11:26,679 --> 00:11:29,440
not to mention obtaining
the phoenix crown and Jade Buddha Head,

153
00:11:30,879 --> 00:11:33,080
your Xiaosheng Society and the Japanese

154
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:36,120
might not even be able
to keep a foothold in Fengcheng.

155
00:11:38,600 --> 00:11:42,080
Can those ignorant people
hold them back?

156
00:11:44,320 --> 00:11:47,279
Xu You'an won't kill civilians,

157
00:11:47,799 --> 00:11:49,559
but he's impulsive by nature.

158
00:11:50,279 --> 00:11:53,799
If he's provoked, and accidentally
kills some ignorant people,

159
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:59,399
then we can incite all the people
of the city to overthrow him.

160
00:12:43,759 --> 00:12:45,000
Governor Xu.

161
00:12:45,919 --> 00:12:46,960
What a rare guest.

162
00:12:48,799 --> 00:12:50,200
Who are you?

163
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:58,639
Just someone
who almost died eight years ago.

164
00:12:59,559 --> 00:13:00,480
Eight years ago?

165
00:13:06,919 --> 00:13:07,799
Xu You'an,

166
00:13:08,919 --> 00:13:10,519
I overestimated you.

167
00:13:13,679 --> 00:13:14,559
I know

168
00:13:16,200 --> 00:13:20,200
that your mother was also killed
by Jiang Xiaoren and his men.

169
00:13:21,240 --> 00:13:23,799
I thought you could solve the case
from eight years ago.

170
00:13:25,279 --> 00:13:28,240
As expected, men cannot be trusted.

171
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:29,240
My mother

172
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:34,320
was killed by President Jiang?

173
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:37,320
Zhao Shengge was not the murderer?

174
00:13:39,440 --> 00:13:40,360
Ridiculous!

175
00:13:41,279 --> 00:13:43,080
Even I could figure out the truth,

176
00:13:43,759 --> 00:13:45,759
yet you cannot?

177
00:13:47,600 --> 00:13:49,080
Come to Governor Mansion with me.

178
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:50,399
I will figure out the truth.

179
00:14:01,399 --> 00:14:02,399
What did you do?

180
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:05,159
Just lit some datura.

181
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:07,159
You won't die for now.

182
00:14:11,519 --> 00:14:13,519
I'll give you one last chance.

183
00:14:13,840 --> 00:14:15,279
Don't make any more mistakes.

184
00:14:16,159 --> 00:14:18,279
It's not worth risking your life.

185
00:14:18,679 --> 00:14:19,480
Chance?

186
00:14:26,200 --> 00:14:27,240
Let me tell you,

187
00:14:29,440 --> 00:14:32,320
in this world, there is no place
to even raise a grievance.

188
00:14:33,960 --> 00:14:35,879
Other than petitioning with my life,

189
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:39,679
what else can I do?

190
00:14:42,159 --> 00:14:43,840
I thought you would be different,

191
00:14:45,639 --> 00:14:47,320
but it seems you're all the same.

192
00:15:17,055 --> 00:15:18,335
♪As if it were fate♪

193
00:15:18,335 --> 00:15:19,692
♪Deliberately playing tricks♪

194
00:15:20,254 --> 00:15:23,491
♪We miss each other♪

195
00:15:24,735 --> 00:15:26,303
♪Creating a turbulent drama♪

196
00:15:26,303 --> 00:15:28,703
♪And a bizarre♪

197
00:15:28,703 --> 00:15:31,505
♪Anonymous legend♪

198
00:15:32,035 --> 00:15:34,047
♪The plot twists and turns♪

199
00:15:34,195 --> 00:15:35,935
♪Play out over and over again♪

200
00:15:35,935 --> 00:15:38,999
♪Waiting to be discarded♪

201
00:15:39,580 --> 00:15:41,279
♪And you are like a moth to the flame♪

202
00:15:41,279 --> 00:15:42,271
♪Refuse to submit♪

203
00:15:42,271 --> 00:15:45,471
♪I can't bear to blame you♪

204
00:15:47,135 --> 00:15:50,047
♪There are always too many♪

205
00:15:50,047 --> 00:15:51,935
♪Helpless situations♪

206
00:15:51,935 --> 00:15:54,559
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

207
00:15:55,690 --> 00:15:57,650
♪Even if I have questions♪

208
00:15:57,650 --> 00:15:59,650
♪I harbor desires♪

209
00:15:59,650 --> 00:16:02,527
♪Nowhere to find answers♪

210
00:16:02,878 --> 00:16:04,511
♪People come and go♪

211
00:16:04,511 --> 00:16:07,327
♪I'm still all alone♪

212
00:16:07,327 --> 00:16:10,055
♪Wandering around♪

213
00:16:10,303 --> 00:16:13,156
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

214
00:16:13,156 --> 00:16:17,617
♪Go through the entanglement♪

215
00:16:17,983 --> 00:16:19,711
♪If longing♪

216
00:16:19,711 --> 00:16:22,870
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

217
00:16:22,870 --> 00:16:25,625
♪How can I be at ease♪

218
00:16:25,727 --> 00:16:28,041
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

219
00:16:28,159 --> 00:16:30,015
♪And travelled around the world♪

220
00:16:30,111 --> 00:16:33,199
♪Scars all over me♪

221
00:16:33,471 --> 00:16:36,383
♪If longing never fades♪

222
00:16:36,383 --> 00:16:37,832
♪Burns still hot♪

223
00:16:37,832 --> 00:16:40,911
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

224
00:16:41,183 --> 00:16:43,040
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

225
00:16:43,103 --> 00:16:44,287
♪In the next life♪

226
00:16:44,287 --> 00:16:48,767
♪Entangle with you again♪
